r skin, as if the stones are breathing.","kind":"event"},{"step":9,"text":"A whisper slips through the archway: 'Wayfinder... follow.'","kind":"event"},{"step":10,"text":"The scorch-hand on the wall is at the height of your own. You do not put yours in it.","kind":"event"},{"step":10,"text":"The growl ahead stops when you stop. It starts when you start.","kind":"event"},{"step":10,"text":"The growl ahead was never a growl. Something steps out of the wall.","kind":"combat"},{"step":13,"text":"A cold gust rattles the shelves, and you smell old ink and rain.","kind":"event"},{"step":13,"text":"A page turns itself on a shelf that no longer exists. You read one word before it is gone: 'Conflux.'","kind":"event"},{"step":13,"text":"Light knots itself between two shelves and turns toward you.","kind":"combat"},{"step":34,"text":"A submerged page unfurls, whispering of the Ley Line Conflux.","kind":"event"},{"step":34,"text":"On the top step of the drowned stair sits a lantern etched with glyphs. The water below it is black, not dark.","kind":"event"},{"step":34,"text":"In the carrel under the east stair a sodden figure clutches a scroll and turns her back to you.","kind":"combat"},{"step":44,"text":"Magic +1 for the rest of this loop.","kind":"event"},{"step":51,"text":"The Heartstone answers your presence with a tremor that shakes dust from the ceiling.","kind":"event"},{"step":61,"text":"Light fractures into false paths, then snaps back into focus.","kind":"event"},{"step":61,"text":"In the cleft a man in a Wayfinder's coat raises a hand. He is gone before it finishes rising.","kind":"event"},{"step":61,"text":"The path doubles. One of the two has teeth.","kind":"combat"},{"step":70,"text":"You rest in Dask's hollow, a cleft that is always the same temperature.","kind":"narration"},{"step":71,"text":"You walked a path that was not there.","kind":"event"},{"step":71,"text":"The spires throb in unison, a slow heartbeat of raw arcana.","kind":"event"},{"step":71,"text":"The hum is not random. It is a chord, held for five hundred years, and it is a little flat.","kind":"event"},{"step":71,"text":"A strand of light unspools from the nearest spire and turns toward you.","kind":"combat"}],"threshold":null}}},
